# Voxel photographer body: chest, spine_02 -> neck_01, with dim cyan piping down the front edges (the rim the
# night needs) and an accent harness band.
name body_chest
grid 5
size 8 7 4
slot suit SwatchMain
slot band SwatchAccent
slot pipe NeonCyan
box 0 0 0 8 7 4 suit
box 3 0 3 4 7 4 band
box 1 0 3 8 1 4 pipe
box 1 6 3 8 7 4 pipe
pivot 0 3 2
